#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_package_label.field_stock_picking__package_label_generation
msgid ""
"When the carrier labels of a delivery are created.\n"
"On validation: the standard flow, every label when the delivery is validated.\n"
"On demand: a button creates the labels of the packages once the delivery is ready; validation creates the missing ones.\n"
"In background: validation is immediate and a scheduled action creates one label per package, for deliveries with many packages.\n"
"When each package is packed: the label of each package is created and printed when the package is packed.\n"
"Except on validation, the carrier integration must create labels per package."
msgstr ""
